    "pesa_governed"
  ],
  "extensions_accepted": [],
  "retroactive": false,
  "supersedes": "a00c9ae782872210cbb4ff74debb6b724c0cb6331ead115f561461cbed2ca639",
  "notes": "Seed profile, version 2.0, supersedes 1.0. Adds the reproof requirement (PP-SPEC-080 4.5, PP-SPEC-081). No thresholds by design: the profile admits proof to a pricing model, it is not the model.",
